<title>USA: COMFORCE Corp completes Rho acquisition.</title>
<headline>COMFORCE Corp completes Rho acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>COMFORCE Corp said on Friday it completed its acquisition of Rho Co for $15 million.</p>
<p>COMFORCE would pay up to an additional $3.3 million over a three-year period based on Rho achieving certain performance levels.</p>
<p>COMFORCE and Rho are both information technology consulting business.</p>
</text>
